  "generated": "---\ntitle: \"Working with incoming calls\"\nslug: \"/apps/android-incoming-calls--ujjxhzvdl5jc1ebe695kxuzi\"\nmdx: {\"format\":\"md\"}\ntags: [\"Android\",\"General\",\"android\",\"basics\",\"working-with-calls\"]\n---\n\nUpon receiving an incoming call, on your mobile device, you will see the following screen:\n\n![](/img/ringotel/original/9a0580c443ce392b36b2/302712a03b8a40784490d6113005fc725c1765516d3dc9e5aaaebf8c5aeb84e2.png)\n\n*1. Drop a call*\n\n*2. Pick up with a video on*\n\n*3. Pick up with audio only*\n\nDuring a call, you have access to the following features:\n\n![](/img/ringotel/original/fcb3d17fc060efedadea/5d8ee3c4eb35beea8c58976af114b2aa02b92a70518db26ccde01a86f57641bb.png)\n\n*1. Mute / unmute microphone*\n\n*2. Put the call on hold*\n\n*3. Turn the speaker on / off, switch to Bluetooth*\n\n*4. Open the Numpad to send DTMF*\n\n*5. Turn call recording on / off*\n\n*6. Open a contact's profile*\n\n*7. Transfer a call*\n\n*8. Make a parallel call*\n\n*9. Turn video on / off*\n\n*10. Open a chat with the contact*\n\n## Related articles\n\n- [Switching between two lines during a call](/docs/apps/android-switching-lines--c8e4jfo3wvtby5vkotervkh3)\n- [Transfer a call](/docs/apps/android-transfer-call--ukk2ikysb3a6guqd8gzugh87)\n"
